}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le10ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Manager</span>: Sorry folks. The weather outside must have knocked out a power line. Consequently, we have a temporary power outage, but there is no need to leave as we have plenty of candles. For this reason, you can continue playing your games and enjoying your beverages and snacks while we wait for the power to come back on. The staff is coming around to your tables and passing out some candles.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: So? What do you guys want to do? Do you want to stay or venture out and try to get back home?</br >", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le10ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "33500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, the power is out in the area and there's a blizzard outside. For this reason, I think we should stay. I think it's safer to stay indoors.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The servers all lit the candles; as a consequence, it's cozy in here now. We should stay. I'm enjoying the atmosphere in here now.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: There go the fire trucks. A tree must have fallen on a power line.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Or the weight of the snow and the wind might have snapped the power pole.</br >", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le10ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "62000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Haa. I'm saying a car might have lost control and hit the power line.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ooo. Good one. How about Godzilla may have stepped on a transformer as he shuffled through the city earlier this evening; as a consequence the power is out for the entire Boston area.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Let's not be macabre people. It's a nasty evening out here, consequently someone might be having a more perilous evening than us.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Perilous! Nice word. Perfect for a double letter score.</br >\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I agree. Let's get this show on the road.</br >", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le10ob10re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le10ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le10ob10re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}